WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.000
<v Lena>Welcome to Coreloom. In the next forty seconds, you'll set up your first workspace.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
<v Lena>Your workspace holds your projects, your files and the people you work with.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
<v Lena>Everything lives in the sidebar on the left.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.500
<v Lena>To create a project, press New project and give it a name.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:21.000
<v Lena>Pick a template if you like: it fills in the first tasks for you.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.000
<v Lena>You can rename the project or change its template at any time.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.000
<v Lena>Now invite your team: open Members and enter their email addresses.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.500
<v Lena>Each person gets a role. Editors change things, viewers only read.

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:39.500
<v Lena>That's it. You're ready to start.
